**Choose your difficulty**

Pick a mode, then submit your guess with **/guesschallenge** and your map name.

**Rules**
- You get **one guess total**.
- Before guessing, you can switch to an easier difficulty, but never a harder one.
- Your mode is remembered, so you only need to specify it if you've started zoom-out.

